## Development

This project uses `uv` for dependency management and a Nix flake for the development environment.

If you use direnv, run:

```bash
direnv allow
```

Otherwise enter the shell with:

```bash
nix develop
```

Install dependencies:

```bash
uv sync
```

This installs the default dev tools (ruff, pyright, pytest). To also install
tox, run:

```bash
uv sync --extra dev
```

or use the Nix flake, which provides tox directly.

## Commands

- `uv run pytest` — run tests
- `uv run ruff check .` — lint
- `uv run ruff format .` — format
- `uv run pyright` — typecheck
- `tox` — run the full test matrix (requires tox, see above)
{% if cli %}- `uv run {{ name }}` — run the CLI
